    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9548" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεισ-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰγ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>introduce, import instead,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				9.39
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				369e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				402.16
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>bring in to office,</i> etc., <i>in turn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλους εἰς ἐπαρχίας κτλ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>restore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.75
			</span></i>, al.</div>
